  "watchdog": "Modbus/BACnet timeout under Main > Setup > BMS: if no write with fresh values arrives in time the unit reverts to its own controls (the manual quotes 5-120 s, default 10 s, in one place and 0-120 s in another). Commands without temperatures must be refreshed at least every 4 minutes.",
  "quirks": [
   "Modicon addressing: 30009 is input register 8 on the wire.",
   "Temperatures are degrees C x 10.",
   "A setpoint sent through 40003 is the 0-10 V equivalent percentage interpolated from the BMS low/high setpoint parameters, not degrees.",
   "Read the lockout code only when the matching status code is 40."
